## Helm values

```yaml
# config.yaml

config:
  clusters:
    - url: https://cluster-api-1.exmple.com:8006/api2/json
      insecure: false
      token_id: "proxmox-mcp@pve!mcp"
      token_secret: "key"
      region: cluster-1
```

## Deploy

```shell
helm upgrade -i --namespace=kube-system -f config.yaml \
    proxmox-mcp oci://ghcr.io/sergelogvinov/charts/proxmox-mcp
```

